@flexiarg musn/read-aif-plus-one
@title Read AIF Suggestion Plus One
@sigils [🗿/三]
@audience fulab agents, musn server
@tone technical
@style pattern
@provenance no grounding source found for this pattern; deterministic search receipt: runs/L10-no-source-check.edn (L6-L10 sweep, 2026-09-05)

! conclusion: Read the AIF-suggested pattern plus one other candidate before acting.

  + context: Pattern guidance is more useful when grounded in at least two candidate reads.

  + IF:
    The agent acts after reading only the suggested pattern or none at all.

  + HOWEVER:
    Candidate lists may be short or empty in some runs.

  + THEN:
    If candidates exist, read the AIF suggestion plus one additional candidate before tools.

  + BECAUSE:
    Comparative reads reduce fixation and improve PSR rationale quality.

  + NEXT-STEPS:
    - evidence: two pattern-action read events recorded for candidates in the same turn.
    - evidence-shape: {:pattern/id :string, :action "read", :turn :int}
